57
- **Preflight gates every spawn.** After `git worktree add`, run
58
  `scripts/preflight.sh --worktree <WT> [--expect-closed <DEP> --plan <plan>]` —
59
  exit 0 = spawn; a HARD fail is an off-spine halt (orchestration.md §1.5/§1.6),
