{"ts": "2026-07-24T14:59:05.997Z", "seq": 73, "kind": "observation", "summary": "MARKDOWN GATE IS RED ON MAIN since c366d6e0 (2026-07-02): 9 errors (MD001 x1, MD025 x8) in dev/research/personal-agent-database-market-2026-07-02.md, appendix headings are # instead of ##. Unseen for 3 weeks because TC-37 makes agent-lint-md.sh exit 0 vacuously in a worktree (no node_modules) - every orchestrator read a vacuous green. Regression vs the 0.8.9.1 debt-to-zero achievement. Placed: DOC-HYGIENE-1 tranche T1/0 (fix headings) + T3/9b (make a missing linter a HARD failure).", "decider": "steward", "id": "TC-49", "status": "open", "refs": ["git:c366d6e0", "prompt:dev/plans/prompts/DOC-HYGIENE-1-HANDOFF.md"]}
